WEBVTT

01:18.340 --> 01:21.870
[Love Has Fireworks]

01:21.900 --> 01:24.789
[Episode 19]

01:34.350 --> 01:35.430
I feel a bit lonely

01:37.960 --> 01:39.350
eating alone.

01:59.789 --> 02:00.600
You're home.

02:02.000 --> 02:03.860
I thought you wouldn't come back.

02:04.070 --> 02:07.280
I didn't expect you to sneak back
and have all the dishes ready.

02:07.280 --> 02:09.550
Why didn't you tell me earlier?
I've been wandering for a long time.

02:09.550 --> 02:11.230
I'm starving. There's nothing to eat.

02:11.230 --> 02:12.000
Let's eat.

02:22.000 --> 02:23.620
Time to eat.

02:23.950 --> 02:25.280
I forgot my chopsticks.

02:40.550 --> 02:41.230
Delicious.

02:45.630 --> 02:47.329
Your cooking is the best.

02:50.000 --> 02:51.860
Today's dishes are so delicious.

02:53.000 --> 02:53.660
Delicious.

02:55.760 --> 02:56.350
Li Yifei.

02:58.390 --> 02:59.520
I suddenly feel that

03:00.320 --> 03:02.180
it wouldn't be appropriate

03:02.760 --> 03:04.820
if we keep living together like this.

03:23.110 --> 03:23.790
You always

03:24.390 --> 03:26.590
vent your anger on me when you're upset.

03:30.720 --> 03:31.650
It's delicious.

03:34.200 --> 03:35.460
You'd better move out.

03:37.070 --> 03:37.670
I told you

03:37.670 --> 03:40.930
not to take it out on me every time
things aren't going well.

03:48.440 --> 03:49.880
When I can afford a villa,

03:49.880 --> 03:50.840
I'll move out.

03:57.600 --> 03:59.730
You're making me very upset, you know?

04:02.600 --> 04:04.720
I won't move out.

04:06.350 --> 04:07.450
I'm used to living here.

04:07.450 --> 04:09.130
But I'm not used to it.

04:09.550 --> 04:11.920
I'm bothered by this, okay?

04:13.750 --> 04:16.220
Why are you so nice to me for no reason?

04:17.430 --> 04:19.160
It's you who asked someone

04:19.180 --> 04:20.750
to deal with Wang Ruohai's trending issue.

04:20.750 --> 04:22.600
Why did you pretend not to know?

04:23.460 --> 04:25.690
Why didn't you tell me anything?

04:27.670 --> 04:29.750
Tell me. Why didn't you tell me?

04:51.790 --> 04:53.080
Aren't you made of steel?

04:53.080 --> 04:54.380
Why are you crying?

04:55.100 --> 04:55.790
Hurry up.

05:00.280 --> 05:01.600
Alright, stop crying.

05:04.990 --> 05:06.450
I'll raise the rent, okay?

05:07.420 --> 05:09.070
Nope.

05:09.480 --> 05:11.190
You have to move out even so.

05:14.960 --> 05:17.550
How much will you raise?

05:21.840 --> 05:23.720
1,000 yuan, okay?

05:25.340 --> 05:26.730
Per quarter?

05:27.500 --> 05:29.570
1,000 yuan a month, okay?

05:31.750 --> 05:32.880
That's more like it.

05:33.480 --> 05:35.710
You money grubber. I knew it.

05:39.280 --> 05:41.210
You're blinded by money. Eat. Eat.

05:44.670 --> 05:46.130
601, your delivery.

05:46.310 --> 05:47.040
I'll get it.

05:55.600 --> 05:56.860
It's addressed to you.

06:10.500 --> 06:12.580
[Legal Notice]

06:14.080 --> 06:15.080
What's wrong now?

06:18.190 --> 06:20.720
It's a legal notice from Shan Li Fang.

06:31.340 --> 06:33.430
[Legal Notice]

06:33.480 --> 06:33.950
[The video has led to a lot of netizens']

06:33.970 --> 06:34.540
[misunderstandings
and negative comments
about the principal.]

06:34.570 --> 06:35.140
[This was done without
the consent of the principal,]

06:35.170 --> 06:35.580
[and affected the principal's
reputation and personality,]

06:35.610 --> 06:36.090
[causing trouble to the principal.
This is extremely egregious.]

06:36.230 --> 06:38.400
You also received a legal notice, right?

06:38.400 --> 06:40.310
This is targeting us.

06:41.550 --> 06:42.520
I got it.

06:44.870 --> 06:46.190
One of the videos

06:46.190 --> 06:47.990
was uploaded by me.

06:48.640 --> 06:50.640
I was so angry.

06:50.980 --> 06:52.110
I just wanted to show the public

06:52.110 --> 06:53.950
what Wang Ruohai did.

06:54.670 --> 06:57.960
I didn't expect this to happen.

06:58.280 --> 06:59.750
Sorry, Fei.

07:01.110 --> 07:02.450
It's okay, Yu.

07:03.080 --> 07:04.110
I'll find a way.

07:05.640 --> 07:07.490
What can you do?

07:08.060 --> 07:09.620
It says

07:09.960 --> 07:12.210
that we should apologize

07:12.350 --> 07:14.520
in 48 hours and pay compensation.

07:15.310 --> 07:16.670
Or they will appeal.

07:17.520 --> 07:19.790
Do you really intend to defend in court?

07:20.870 --> 07:21.930
Let's wait and see.

07:23.750 --> 07:25.400
If it were my own business,

07:25.420 --> 07:26.640
I wouldn't be afraid.

07:26.920 --> 07:29.250
But you're involved in this.

07:29.790 --> 07:31.760
If you lose your hard-won job

07:31.790 --> 07:33.450
because of this,

07:33.480 --> 07:34.670
I'll feel guilty.

07:36.750 --> 07:38.370
Let's wait and see.

07:39.520 --> 07:41.490
Alright, don't overthink it.

07:41.600 --> 07:42.450
Rest early.

08:04.940 --> 08:05.670
Come in.

08:13.040 --> 08:15.040
Don't worry about the legal notice.

08:15.350 --> 08:16.810
It's just a scare tactic.

08:16.870 --> 08:18.930
They're just trying to frighten you.

08:21.040 --> 08:22.060
You don't have to comfort me.

08:22.060 --> 08:23.490
It's okay. Go to sleep.

09:08.640 --> 09:10.430
Ms. Liao didn't come to the office today.

09:10.430 --> 09:11.880
I have something important

09:11.880 --> 09:13.610
to talk to Vice President Liao.

09:14.360 --> 09:15.760
Everyone here wants to see her

09:15.760 --> 09:16.880
says it's urgent.

09:16.950 --> 09:17.550
I suggest you

09:17.550 --> 09:19.950
make an appointment with her
for next week.

09:48.550 --> 09:49.480
Hello, Ms. Liao.

09:51.710 --> 09:52.600
What's the matter?

09:52.600 --> 09:54.640
I couldn't catch you in the office,

09:54.670 --> 09:56.110
so I had no choice but to wait here.

09:56.110 --> 09:57.670
I'm really sorry about that.

09:57.670 --> 09:59.040
I came to tell you that

09:59.160 --> 10:00.920
I've received the legal notice

10:00.950 --> 10:02.610
from Shan Li Fang Hotel Group.

10:05.280 --> 10:05.760
Go on.

10:07.710 --> 10:09.840
I want to sincerely apologize to you.

10:09.880 --> 10:11.280
I didn't expect this incident to

10:11.280 --> 10:12.710
have such serious consequences.

10:12.710 --> 10:14.480
I'm sorry

10:14.710 --> 10:16.590
for affecting your reputation
and that of the Hotel.

10:16.590 --> 10:17.790
Why didn't you apologize before?

10:17.790 --> 10:19.920
So, the legal notice actually worked?

10:20.190 --> 10:21.590
What brought me here to apologize

10:21.590 --> 10:22.990
was not the legal notice.

10:23.020 --> 10:25.450
As my personal matter

10:25.950 --> 10:27.040
has had wider repercussions,

10:27.040 --> 10:29.010
it's no longer a personal matter.

10:29.790 --> 10:30.960
Besides me,

10:31.120 --> 10:32.790
Dang Yu from He Jing Securities

10:32.790 --> 10:34.590
has also received a legal notice.

10:34.590 --> 10:36.040
As a member of a partner organization

10:36.040 --> 10:37.470
of Shan Li Fang Hotel Group,

10:37.470 --> 10:39.090
it was thoughtless of her

10:39.280 --> 10:40.710
to upload that video,

10:40.830 --> 10:43.090
which has caused serious consequences.

10:43.520 --> 10:44.640
She's willing to

10:44.640 --> 10:45.920
mitigate the negative impact

10:45.920 --> 10:47.280
on Shan Li Fang Hotel Group

10:47.280 --> 10:48.880
together with me.

10:49.120 --> 10:50.040
I hope you can

10:50.240 --> 10:51.280
forgive us.

10:52.200 --> 10:53.400
What you mentioned is

10:53.430 --> 10:55.560
the decision of our legal department.

10:55.650 --> 10:58.250
So, we'll handle the follow-up

10:58.280 --> 11:00.880
according to
the legal department's procedures.

11:00.880 --> 11:02.680
Ms. Liao, Ms. Liao, please wait.

11:05.520 --> 11:07.830
Dang Yu did this for my sake.

11:19.000 --> 11:19.730
Qian Fei,

11:21.590 --> 11:23.470
Director Fang asked you to make a list of

11:23.470 --> 11:24.790
your tasks immediately,

11:24.790 --> 11:26.850
pack up your stuff, and report to her.

11:27.040 --> 11:28.240
For today's meeting,

11:28.710 --> 11:30.110
you don't have to attend.

11:33.960 --> 11:34.600
Well,

11:34.950 --> 11:35.680
hand it over.

11:56.830 --> 11:59.290
[Detailed Breakdown of
Shan Li Fang Hotel Group's Assets]

12:11.120 --> 12:12.560
Let's do waste sorting.

12:11.210 --> 12:14.650
[Let's Do Waste Sorting]

12:12.580 --> 12:13.210
Take one.

12:13.240 --> 12:14.790
This is kitchen waste.

12:14.920 --> 12:15.720
Throw it here.

12:15.790 --> 12:16.400
Thank you.

12:16.550 --> 12:17.480
You're welcome.

12:18.500 --> 12:19.980
Let's do waste sorting.

12:20.320 --> 12:21.190
Thank you.

12:21.330 --> 12:22.740
Let's do waste sorting.

12:22.920 --> 12:24.830
Madam, what's inside?

12:25.120 --> 12:26.520
This is the residue of Chinese medicine.

12:26.520 --> 12:28.130
This is wet waste.

12:28.160 --> 12:29.160
Put it in this bin.

12:29.160 --> 12:29.710
Thank you.

12:29.710 --> 12:30.640
You're welcome.

12:30.670 --> 12:31.460
Thank you.

12:58.470 --> 12:59.860
It's almost time.

13:00.430 --> 13:01.920
I'll stay and wait for Team Two
to take over.

13:01.920 --> 13:02.590
You guys go back first.

13:02.590 --> 13:04.310
-Okay.
-Alright. We'll go eat first.

13:04.310 --> 13:04.830
Give it to me.

13:04.830 --> 13:05.670
Thank you.

13:08.310 --> 13:09.460
Waste sorting.

13:09.790 --> 13:11.450
Why is she live streaming now?

13:14.590 --> 13:15.590
Hello, everyone.

13:15.790 --> 13:18.420
I'm the one who filmed the chaos
in Shan Li Fang Hotel Group

13:16.890 --> 13:25.700
[Bad Name Took Me Forever]

13:18.590 --> 13:20.390
caused by a cheating jerk.

13:21.670 --> 13:23.120
As for this live stream,

13:23.240 --> 13:25.830
I want to apologize to
the person in the video.

13:26.590 --> 13:27.520
This video

13:27.830 --> 13:29.920
was filmed and uploaded

13:30.190 --> 13:32.180
without the permission of
the party concerned.

13:32.130 --> 13:35.760
[Bad Name Took Me Forever]

13:32.880 --> 13:34.250
I also added the text

13:34.430 --> 13:35.850
to the video.

13:36.280 --> 13:38.070
It has nothing to do with others.

13:38.070 --> 13:40.590
I feel uneasy

13:40.590 --> 13:42.370
for disrupting his normal life.

13:42.370 --> 13:44.220
The text and title in the video

13:44.250 --> 13:45.910
are not appropriate.

13:47.760 --> 13:49.580
I will take full responsibility

13:49.640 --> 13:51.170
for damaging the individual's reputation.

13:51.170 --> 13:54.320
[Bad Name Took Me Forever]

13:51.360 --> 13:52.280
Furthermore,

13:54.520 --> 13:55.830
my claim that he cheated

13:55.830 --> 13:59.160
was pure speculation on my part
without any investigation.

13:59.360 --> 14:01.160
Back then,

14:01.240 --> 14:03.440
he did break up with his ex-girlfriend.

14:03.510 --> 14:05.540
I misunderstood that he cheated on her.

14:04.080 --> 14:05.390
[Are you okay?]

14:05.830 --> 14:08.400
So, please stop doxxing them

14:09.430 --> 14:10.780
and stop insulting them.

14:10.780 --> 14:12.700
It's all my fault.

14:13.070 --> 14:14.790
You can scold me if you want.

14:14.720 --> 14:17.170
[Bad Name Took Me Forever]

14:21.850 --> 14:22.870
[Call]

14:22.900 --> 14:23.350
[Bad Name]

14:30.920 --> 14:34.180
-The number you dialed is turned off.
-What happened, Jun?

14:35.640 --> 14:36.380
I have something urgent.

14:36.380 --> 14:37.780
I have to leave right now.

15:01.880 --> 15:04.540
Sorry, the subscriber
you dialed is turned off.

15:09.320 --> 15:16.220
[Bad Name Took Me Forever]

15:13.320 --> 15:14.200
Wait.

15:14.360 --> 15:16.190
What nonsense are you talking about?

15:16.190 --> 15:17.810
I'm apologizing.

15:18.830 --> 15:20.730
Yes, I'm fickle.

15:20.870 --> 15:22.500
When I posted that video,
you guys made a fuss.

15:22.500 --> 15:23.750
I'm apologizing now.
Why are you still making a fuss?

15:23.750 --> 15:25.310
Are you so idle?

15:26.760 --> 15:27.880
Dox me?

15:27.950 --> 15:29.420
Come on. Just dox me.

15:29.550 --> 15:30.680
I'm not frightened.

15:30.790 --> 15:32.240
You'd better come to me.

15:33.360 --> 15:34.360
You're all crazy.

15:37.750 --> 15:38.630
[Don't expose your identity
in the live stream.]

15:38.660 --> 15:39.880
[No one has doxxed you yet.
What do you admit?]

15:39.910 --> 15:41.230
[Are you stupid? Get offline now.
Don't argue with them.]

15:41.720 --> 15:42.990
[They just want to watch the show.]

15:43.050 --> 15:44.960
[Don't expose your real identity.
I'll solve other things for you.]

15:44.980 --> 15:45.890
[Don't get involved.]

15:47.280 --> 15:49.010
Fine, I'll end the live stream.

16:08.890 --> 16:10.990
[Livestream]

16:10.160 --> 16:11.360
Bad Name must have thought it through

16:11.360 --> 16:14.040
before doing that.

16:11.410 --> 16:13.160
[Prime Minister]

16:14.520 --> 16:15.830
As bystanders,

16:15.910 --> 16:17.360
we don't know what exactly happened.

16:17.360 --> 16:18.830
So, we shouldn't make comments carelessly.

16:17.440 --> 16:25.050
[Prime Minister]

16:19.160 --> 16:21.090
If we really want to know the truth,

16:21.190 --> 16:22.430
we should listen to

16:22.520 --> 16:24.380
what Bad Name wants to say calmly.

16:24.580 --> 16:24.980
Right?

16:25.280 --> 16:26.430
To be honest,

16:26.630 --> 16:28.870
I know Bad Name in real life.

16:29.000 --> 16:30.040
A few days ago,

16:29.060 --> 16:31.980
[Prime Minister]

16:30.120 --> 16:31.590
she volunteered in our community,

16:31.590 --> 16:34.320
helping residents learn
how to sort their waste.

16:35.430 --> 16:37.220
What does Jun mean?

16:37.440 --> 16:39.550
-He wants to expose his identity?
-Yes.

16:39.550 --> 16:40.880
I'm a civil servant.

16:40.900 --> 16:42.590
-She's so annoying.
-But I'm a fan of Bad Name.

16:42.590 --> 16:44.350
-For this girl, Jun doesn't care about
-What I said just now

16:44.350 --> 16:46.330
-his identity and work.
-is not for fame.

16:46.330 --> 16:48.520
-And I'm not being nosy.
-I don't think it's that serious.

16:48.520 --> 16:50.280
-It's okay as long as Jun
-I'm just calling you.

16:50.280 --> 16:51.840
-doesn't lie or spread rumors.
-to be friendly.

16:51.840 --> 16:53.400
Do you think it's fine

16:53.400 --> 16:55.150
as long as
he doesn't lie or spread rumors?

16:55.150 --> 16:56.320
Nowadays,

16:56.320 --> 16:57.470
I'm telling you, those netizens

16:57.470 --> 16:59.040
are capable.

16:59.120 --> 17:00.900
If his name

17:00.950 --> 17:02.520
and work are exposed,

17:02.600 --> 17:04.930
his future development will be affected.

17:06.490 --> 17:07.760
Your words make sense.

17:09.920 --> 17:12.119
Yes, I can't do anything to you.

17:12.190 --> 17:13.520
I just think that

17:14.640 --> 17:15.839
we must have a yardstick

17:15.839 --> 17:17.359
and a standard

17:17.359 --> 17:18.430
in our hearts.

17:18.839 --> 17:19.770
In front of right and wrong,

17:19.770 --> 17:21.510
we have to learn to restrain ourselves.

17:21.510 --> 17:24.369
We need to take the initiative
at critical moments.

17:31.750 --> 17:32.640
Who is this?

17:32.840 --> 17:34.770
He even has the same birthday as me?

17:35.830 --> 17:36.080
[Jun, are you crazy?]

17:36.150 --> 17:37.500
[Don’t act tough for Dang Yu.
Have you thought about yourself?]

17:37.520 --> 17:39.320
[Have you thought about your parents?]

17:40.670 --> 17:43.440
I have to do something
rather than hiding aside

17:43.510 --> 17:45.370
when I see my friend being bullied

17:43.670 --> 17:46.760
[Prime Minister]

17:45.400 --> 17:47.130
and someone spreading rumors.

17:47.190 --> 17:48.720
I'm not that kind of person.

17:50.360 --> 17:52.350
Don't worry. I know what to do.

17:52.370 --> 17:53.590
I know what to do.

17:54.820 --> 17:57.420
[Turn off the live stream]

17:59.740 --> 18:00.570
[Will you block Baby Blue Bear 0122?]
[Yes]

18:07.530 --> 18:08.170
[What if your work
gets affected because of this?]

18:08.190 --> 18:08.940
[Stop messing around. Listen to me.
Turn off the live stream.]

18:08.970 --> 18:09.740
[Like for the anchor]

18:13.320 --> 18:14.270
He blocked me.

18:14.600 --> 18:15.400
Try again.

18:18.470 --> 18:19.730
He really blocked you.

18:19.800 --> 18:20.880
What the hell?

18:21.750 --> 18:22.190
Fine.

18:22.310 --> 18:23.270
Look.

18:23.300 --> 18:25.800
Our son has only been
in contact with her for a few days.

18:25.800 --> 18:27.110
But he has become like this.

18:27.110 --> 18:28.560
We can't let them be together.

18:28.560 --> 18:30.030
-Don’t let him be together with that girl.
-Okay. Okay.

18:30.030 --> 18:31.490
Calm down. Don't be angry.

18:31.500 --> 18:33.080
He doesn't know you're angry.

18:33.080 --> 18:34.550
It's bad for your health.

18:34.840 --> 18:35.700
Don't be angry.

18:36.240 --> 18:38.100
He doesn't want to come back, huh?

18:39.500 --> 18:41.110
-Fine. He doesn't want to come back.
-What are you doing?

18:41.110 --> 18:42.510
I'll go to the subdistrict office
to find him.

18:42.510 --> 18:44.800
Honey, calm down.

18:44.820 --> 18:45.760
Calm down.

18:46.160 --> 18:47.120
Calm down.

18:48.560 --> 18:49.490
I'll go find him.

18:49.560 --> 18:51.080
Honey, impulse is the devil.

18:51.080 --> 18:52.340
I'm a devil now!

18:52.670 --> 18:53.530
Dear netizens,

18:53.560 --> 18:55.580
I was talking to my friend.

18:55.710 --> 18:57.920
Anyway, I would like to urge everyone

18:57.920 --> 18:58.880
to think carefully before speaking.

18:58.880 --> 18:59.800
Be cautious.

18:59.950 --> 19:02.360
No matter who is at fault,

19:02.510 --> 19:03.990
we should all approach these matters

19:03.990 --> 19:05.850
with kindness and reason, right?

19:54.030 --> 19:55.830
Look, Jun is doing a live stream.

19:57.750 --> 20:00.360
He has been live streaming
the whole day without moving.

20:00.360 --> 20:01.030
Look.

20:01.230 --> 20:03.160
If we really want to know the truth,

20:03.230 --> 20:04.290
we should listen to

20:04.360 --> 20:06.220
what Bad Name wants to say calmly.

20:06.400 --> 20:07.030
Right?

20:08.160 --> 20:09.200
Jun,

20:09.220 --> 20:10.400
-to pursue Dang Yu,
-To be honest,

20:10.400 --> 20:12.190
-is willing to do anything.
-I know Bad Name in real life.

20:12.190 --> 20:13.730
-If I were him,
-A few days ago,

20:13.730 --> 20:15.030
-I would be mad
-she taught our community residents

20:15.030 --> 20:19.030
-after speaking all day in the car.
-how to sort the trash as a volunteer.

20:30.840 --> 20:32.760
Okay, I know you're worried.

20:32.990 --> 20:35.030
Since you've talked to Chairman Liao,

20:35.030 --> 20:36.950
it's better to get off work now

20:37.030 --> 20:38.690
than worry about your future.

20:39.030 --> 20:39.670
Right?

20:39.710 --> 20:41.840
Don't think about anything. Let's go.

20:48.230 --> 20:50.840
I believe you, my landlady,

20:50.920 --> 20:54.330
will make a way through difficulties.

20:54.510 --> 20:56.650
Just eat and drink as normal.

20:56.710 --> 20:57.510
Let's go home.

20:58.230 --> 20:59.610
I thought you had a change of heart

20:59.610 --> 21:01.400
and learned how to comfort others.

21:01.400 --> 21:02.800
But you're just worried about

21:02.800 --> 21:05.060
your dinner.

21:07.360 --> 21:09.470
I only know that in 15 minutes,

21:09.710 --> 21:11.640
there will be traffic congestion.

21:14.430 --> 21:16.270
That's right. Let's go.

21:23.160 --> 21:25.840
Cyberbullying is very scary.

21:25.870 --> 21:26.950
Many cases have proved that,

21:26.950 --> 21:28.280
right?

21:28.300 --> 21:29.430
If something really happens to

21:29.430 --> 21:30.960
Bad Name,

21:31.030 --> 21:33.020
all of us can't get away with it.

21:52.560 --> 21:54.670
To be honest,
after talking with you for so long,

21:54.670 --> 21:56.800
I'm really tired.

21:58.830 --> 22:00.430
I came out for some fresh air.

22:01.120 --> 22:03.600
I hope you can change your mood
and drink some water.

22:03.600 --> 22:05.640
Then, let's continue, okay?

22:07.180 --> 22:08.520
[Xin]

22:10.820 --> 22:12.010
[Xin]

22:16.120 --> 22:16.800
Hello.

22:17.120 --> 22:18.950
Yu, watch the live stream.

22:19.080 --> 22:20.510
There's a guy called Prime Minister.

22:20.510 --> 22:22.230
He has been fighting against the netizens
the whole day for you.

22:22.230 --> 22:23.670
He is among the top 10
on the trending list.

22:23.670 --> 22:24.880
He hasn't stopped yet.

22:24.880 --> 22:26.030
His voice is hoarse.

22:26.250 --> 22:27.720
Is he your admirer?

22:28.160 --> 22:29.150
He is

22:30.190 --> 22:31.160
my friend.

22:32.230 --> 22:34.800
I don't think you are just friends.

22:35.030 --> 22:37.170
He's a nice guy. Don't miss him.

22:49.230 --> 22:50.950
Let's go out and eat something delicious

22:50.950 --> 22:51.750
to treat you.

22:52.920 --> 22:54.030
Forget it.

22:54.400 --> 22:56.430
I still have a few chapters to translate.

22:56.430 --> 22:58.160
Just go home and order takeout.

23:09.670 --> 23:10.560
Hello, dad.

23:10.840 --> 23:11.560
Fei,

23:12.120 --> 23:13.250
are you off work yet?

23:14.030 --> 23:14.950
Yes.

23:16.690 --> 23:18.890
What's going on with that video online?

23:22.080 --> 23:22.890
I...

23:22.920 --> 23:25.840
There was a little misunderstanding
between Wang Ruohai and me.

23:25.840 --> 23:27.190
A little misunderstanding?

23:27.190 --> 23:28.990
But it's all over the internet now.

23:28.990 --> 23:29.880
Tell me.

23:30.270 --> 23:32.430
Is there a dispute over the house

23:32.600 --> 23:33.950
after you broke up?

23:34.990 --> 23:36.640
No. Don't worry.

23:36.670 --> 23:38.340
I'm almost done.

23:38.670 --> 23:41.360
His family needs money urgently.

23:41.640 --> 23:43.120
I have to transfer his share to him

23:43.120 --> 23:45.430
in advance. That's all.

23:45.880 --> 23:47.510
I have some savings here.

23:47.840 --> 23:49.700
I'll transfer it to you tomorrow.

23:50.230 --> 23:51.080
No need.

23:51.080 --> 23:52.910
You don't have much money.

23:53.120 --> 23:55.520
I have investment products bought before.

23:55.750 --> 23:56.750
That's enough.

23:56.920 --> 23:59.670
I only have to transfer the money to him
on time.

24:01.080 --> 24:02.670
I'm on the subway, dad.

24:02.710 --> 24:03.710
Talk to you later.

24:16.120 --> 24:18.720
Why didn't I know you
have financial products?

24:19.880 --> 24:21.430
Sorry.

24:23.360 --> 24:24.270
Ms. Qian.

24:24.710 --> 24:26.570
Do we really have to be so distant?

24:27.710 --> 24:29.110
Are you the real Qian Fei?

24:41.560 --> 24:42.290
Come with me.

24:42.800 --> 24:44.030
What are you doing?

24:44.120 --> 24:45.120
Let go.

25:01.120 --> 25:02.030
Stop it.

25:02.640 --> 25:04.500
We'll get filmed if we make a mess.

25:07.160 --> 25:09.140
Thank you for your concern.

25:09.430 --> 25:11.090
I've had two bottles of water.

25:11.420 --> 25:12.590
I'll buy some later.

25:15.670 --> 25:17.990
Guy, why did you park your car here?

25:17.990 --> 25:19.150
This is my parking space.

25:18.920 --> 25:23.030
[Prime Minister]

25:21.470 --> 25:22.430
I'm sorry.

25:22.430 --> 25:23.320
I'll move it now.

25:23.320 --> 25:23.880
Hurry up.

25:23.880 --> 25:25.230
My son's car is coming back soon.

25:25.230 --> 25:26.190
Okay. Okay. Okay.

25:26.190 --> 25:27.030
Right away.

25:28.470 --> 25:30.670
Hold on, everyone. I need to move my car.

25:48.950 --> 25:51.480
Thank you again
for your concern and support.

25:52.270 --> 25:53.060
Currently,

25:53.230 --> 25:55.560
I see more and more rational comments

25:55.640 --> 25:56.920
online.

25:57.510 --> 26:00.270
I think it's worth it,
though my voice is hoarse.

26:02.030 --> 26:03.340
Thank you so much

26:03.400 --> 26:06.260
for safeguarding the peace of
the internet with me.

26:06.840 --> 26:09.510
I'll end the live stream now.

26:11.030 --> 26:13.080
Goodbye, everyone. Goodbye.

27:04.660 --> 27:06.360
Where are you taking me?

27:07.800 --> 27:09.580
If you promise to make
Stir-Fried Eggplant Strips for me tonight,

27:09.580 --> 27:10.490
I'll tell you.

27:11.270 --> 27:12.840
Can you be serious?

27:13.880 --> 27:15.050
Look at me.

27:15.230 --> 27:17.510
I don't even have the strength to
clean up my mess.

27:17.510 --> 27:19.240
It's impossible for me to cook.

27:19.400 --> 27:20.400
By the way,

27:20.470 --> 27:23.120
have you never had eggplant before?

27:23.190 --> 27:24.450
Aren't you tired of it?

27:25.800 --> 27:27.400
Didn't you want soap operas?

27:28.160 --> 27:29.770
The emperor

27:29.840 --> 27:31.810
ate too many delicacies.

27:31.920 --> 27:34.190
One day, he ate a roasted sweet potato.

27:34.320 --> 27:35.230
Guess what?

27:36.400 --> 27:37.880
He thought it was

27:37.990 --> 27:40.130
the most delicious food in the world.

27:40.600 --> 27:42.600
I'm the same with the emperor.

27:44.470 --> 27:46.080
Don't you feel ashamed?

27:46.100 --> 27:47.580
Look, you are laughing.

27:48.190 --> 27:50.400
It means you are getting better.

27:51.190 --> 27:53.590
I never think face is that important.

27:53.640 --> 27:55.640
The most important thing is spirit.

27:55.710 --> 27:58.360
Life is all about spirit.

27:58.470 --> 27:59.800
When the spirit is gone,

28:00.230 --> 28:01.670
a person will be crushed.

28:03.600 --> 28:04.780
You're right.

28:05.840 --> 28:07.230
I think I'm dying.

28:07.640 --> 28:09.360
You haven't had time yet.

28:09.360 --> 28:11.290
I've already saved you, haven't I?

28:12.360 --> 28:14.560
You can't save me.

28:14.640 --> 28:15.880
I don't know

28:15.950 --> 28:17.900
if I can keep my job.

28:18.710 --> 28:21.450
I don't know
if Dang Yu will be implicated.

28:21.510 --> 28:23.340
I know I shouldn't be anxious.

28:23.430 --> 28:25.090
I have to face whatever comes.

28:26.080 --> 28:28.270
But my brain doesn't listen to orders.

28:28.320 --> 28:29.380
Do you understand?

28:30.160 --> 28:32.270
The uncertain moment

28:32.270 --> 28:34.000
makes people anxious the most.

28:34.030 --> 28:35.120
Normally,

28:35.190 --> 28:36.840
I will make myself

28:36.920 --> 28:38.600
look good

28:38.710 --> 28:40.230
to cheer myself up.

28:42.750 --> 28:46.360
This is the best way to overcome anxiety.

28:47.320 --> 28:48.030
Today,

28:48.750 --> 28:53.600
I will reveal the secret.

28:54.950 --> 28:57.410
Can you speak properly?
I don't understand.

28:57.920 --> 29:01.090
To put it bluntly,
whether you leave or stay tomorrow,

29:01.270 --> 29:02.930
whether you're alive or dead,

29:03.190 --> 29:05.080
whether it's a good ending

29:05.160 --> 29:06.770
or a bad ending,

29:06.880 --> 29:08.880
as long as you can behave appropriately

29:08.880 --> 29:10.020
in front of them,

29:10.080 --> 29:11.190
you'll win half.

29:11.360 --> 29:12.410
Understand?

29:12.840 --> 29:14.170
But look at you now.

29:14.230 --> 29:17.110
From top to bottom,

29:17.190 --> 29:19.750
the only feeling you give others is

29:21.120 --> 29:21.670
sadness.

29:22.880 --> 29:24.080
It's not okay. Landlady.

29:24.080 --> 29:25.010
Listen.

29:25.190 --> 29:27.320
My mission today

29:27.430 --> 29:29.060
is to give me a makeover

29:31.230 --> 29:32.600
Give me a makeover?

29:33.270 --> 29:34.160
How?

29:34.160 --> 29:36.080
If you promise to cook
Stir-Fried Eggplant Strips tonight,

29:36.080 --> 29:37.540
I'll tell you what I'll do.

29:38.630 --> 29:40.790
Get lost!

29:42.950 --> 29:43.770
Come on.

29:44.120 --> 29:45.130
Do it.

29:54.990 --> 29:56.450
Sorry to keep you waiting.

29:57.600 --> 29:58.330
Here you are.

29:58.950 --> 29:59.600
Thank you.

30:05.320 --> 30:06.320
You did live streaming all day in the car

30:06.320 --> 30:08.710
without drinking water
or going to the toilet.

30:08.710 --> 30:10.040
Are you out of your mind?

30:11.990 --> 30:14.790
You can also say that
I'm serious and responsible.

30:15.360 --> 30:17.160
Do you treat everyone like this?

30:18.120 --> 30:19.500
Of course not.

30:19.600 --> 30:20.990
Only you.

30:24.120 --> 30:25.440
So what now?

30:25.470 --> 30:26.560
Just stand here?

30:30.030 --> 30:31.090
Where are we going?

30:32.050 --> 30:33.510
Didn't you always want to ask me out?

30:33.510 --> 30:34.970
Now here comes the chance.

30:35.080 --> 30:37.880
You just let me stand
in front of the public toilet?

30:39.430 --> 30:40.510
You mean

30:41.430 --> 30:43.230
you agreed to go on a date with me?

30:43.800 --> 30:45.930
If you don't move, I'll change my mind.

30:46.470 --> 30:47.390
Let's go.

30:49.160 --> 30:50.220
Where are we going?

30:50.320 --> 30:51.360
Are you bold?

30:51.800 --> 30:52.470
Not bad.

31:02.400 --> 31:04.680
First, if you want to make yourself

31:04.710 --> 31:06.670
look fashionable, energetic, and decent,

31:06.670 --> 31:09.220
you have to dress up, right?

31:09.560 --> 31:11.030
What are you wearing?

31:11.080 --> 31:11.840
Bad texture.

31:11.950 --> 31:14.410
-Isn’t it good?
-What’s this? Elastic band?

31:14.920 --> 31:15.750
And this.

31:16.230 --> 31:18.890
How dare you wear this outside?
It's stretched.

31:20.840 --> 31:22.400
I have no money.
I don't want to buy clothes here.

31:22.400 --> 31:23.240
Go home.

31:24.670 --> 31:26.560
Why are you so stingy?

31:27.120 --> 31:29.050
You can change your name to Stingy.

31:29.640 --> 31:32.040
Don't you feel guilty for
your own surname?

31:32.560 --> 31:33.920
You have to invest.

31:36.560 --> 31:38.320
I have no money.

31:39.710 --> 31:40.270
Fine.

31:40.290 --> 31:42.500
We won't buy top-brand products.

31:42.560 --> 31:44.360
Let's buy some affordable ones.

31:45.120 --> 31:46.750
I can't afford them, either.

31:48.190 --> 31:49.920
Stop being stingy.

31:50.470 --> 31:51.800
These are cheap.

31:51.880 --> 31:54.160
Well, you choose two first.

31:54.270 --> 31:56.030
Take whatever you like.
Don't look at the price.

31:56.030 --> 31:57.360
Just follow your heart.

31:57.470 --> 31:58.470
Come on. Start.

32:12.430 --> 32:14.400
This is pretty. This green one.

32:14.670 --> 32:16.130
It's bright and cheerful.

32:17.320 --> 32:18.950
Right? I like it.

32:21.320 --> 32:22.320
Go on. Go on.

32:32.750 --> 32:33.750
This one is nice, too.

32:33.750 --> 32:35.410
A Peter Pan collar. It's cute.

32:35.710 --> 32:37.230
Stop. Stop. Stop.

32:38.030 --> 32:38.690
Put it back.

32:40.120 --> 32:40.950
I

32:41.190 --> 32:42.430
just want to test

32:42.430 --> 32:43.970
how bad your taste is.

32:44.430 --> 32:46.120
Now that the test is over,

32:48.270 --> 32:50.160
I think your life should end here.

32:51.360 --> 32:52.400
Isn't it pretty?

32:53.750 --> 32:54.610
How about this?

32:55.400 --> 32:56.890
Let me pick some for you.

32:57.840 --> 32:58.640
Let me

32:59.510 --> 33:00.590
rescue your taste.

33:01.510 --> 33:03.110
Let me pick one set casually.

33:05.430 --> 33:06.700
Pair this with this.

33:07.160 --> 33:07.850
Try it on.

33:08.880 --> 33:10.230
Although this set is not that good,

33:10.230 --> 33:11.030
it's better than

33:11.030 --> 33:12.640
what you are wearing

33:12.670 --> 33:14.270
and the ones you just picked.

33:16.120 --> 33:17.530
This is too short.

33:17.560 --> 33:18.920
I've never worn such a short skirt.

33:18.920 --> 33:19.840
Do you have leggings here?

33:19.840 --> 33:20.400
Give her one pair.

33:20.400 --> 33:23.080
-Yes, one moment.
-Are you crazy? Buy leggings here?

33:23.080 --> 33:26.140
-It only costs 28 online. Free shipping.
-Cut the crap.

33:26.190 --> 33:27.050
Go get changed.

33:36.990 --> 33:38.200
It's so strange.

33:38.270 --> 33:39.160
Let me change it.

33:39.160 --> 33:39.880
No.

33:40.400 --> 33:42.320
Ms. Qian, come out and let me have a look.

33:42.080 --> 33:43.960
♪ I really miss you ♪

33:42.320 --> 33:43.190
Is that okay?

33:44.600 --> 33:45.690
♪ My heart is pounding fast ♪

33:46.440 --> 33:49.170
♪ Syncing my breath
to a frequency that longs for you ♪

33:49.960 --> 33:51.020
♪ I love you so much ♪

33:51.780 --> 33:54.450
♪ The only you in the whole world ♪

33:56.950 --> 34:00.170
♪ Living in my heart ♪

34:02.650 --> 34:05.500
♪ The sweetness of ice cream
mixed with the saltiness of tears ♪

34:05.760 --> 34:07.280
See? I told you it's weird.

34:05.840 --> 34:08.969
♪ I've tucked all my words
into viral quotes ♪

34:09.239 --> 34:10.469
It doesn't suit me at all.

34:09.449 --> 34:12.600
♪ I look up at the bright moon,
and you lean down to kiss me ♪

34:10.469 --> 34:11.280
It's not my style.

34:11.280 --> 34:12.610
It doesn’t look like me.

34:13.010 --> 34:15.670
♪ Like spring soil nourishing flowers,
I'll protect you ♪

34:14.280 --> 34:15.070
Li Yifei!

34:16.380 --> 34:19.790
♪ You're the joy of my youth.
You're the boy I love ♪

34:19.550 --> 34:21.550
I didn't expect you to
have such a good figure.

34:20.530 --> 34:23.020
♪ The moonlight shines on the river,
and I chase after you ♪

34:23.030 --> 34:25.110
You have a thin waist and long legs.

34:23.500 --> 34:27.380
♪ My posts you praised make me glad ♪

34:27.870 --> 34:29.670
What a sharp tongue.

34:28.380 --> 34:30.850
♪ Cranes return to the lonely mountain,
and I belong to you ♪

34:31.630 --> 34:32.510
Look!

34:33.080 --> 34:35.080
♪ I really miss you ♪

34:33.590 --> 34:35.530
You've even used sophisticated words
to curse me.

34:35.530 --> 34:36.900
♪ My heart is pounding fast ♪

34:36.360 --> 34:37.159
Sounds great.

34:37.330 --> 34:40.270
♪ Syncing my breath
to a frequency that longs for you ♪

34:38.719 --> 34:39.550
Let me see.

34:39.880 --> 34:41.239
Now you only need a pair of high heels.

34:40.909 --> 34:42.040
♪ I love you so much ♪

34:41.280 --> 34:42.139
We're all done.

34:42.199 --> 34:43.070
Let's go. Pay the bill.

34:42.790 --> 34:45.560
♪ The only you in the whole world ♪

34:43.199 --> 34:44.150
Really?

34:45.550 --> 34:46.800
How much are these?

34:48.270 --> 34:52.840
♪ Living in my heart ♪

34:48.590 --> 34:51.120
It's 3,000 yuan in total.
Cash or credit card?

34:53.320 --> 34:55.380
[Lujiazui Dongyuan Subdistrict Office]

34:55.460 --> 35:00.150
[Security Room]

34:55.679 --> 34:56.550
Li.

34:57.240 --> 34:58.360
Hello, Jun's mom.

34:58.400 --> 35:00.360
We're here to see Jun.

35:00.680 --> 35:02.080
Jun hasn't come back yet.

35:03.670 --> 35:05.790
He's not back? Where...

35:05.880 --> 35:06.590
Auntie.

35:07.030 --> 35:08.280
Jun is off this afternoon.

35:08.280 --> 35:09.200
He didn't come to the office.

35:09.200 --> 35:10.630
Do you know where he went?

35:10.720 --> 35:11.950
He called me this afternoon

35:11.950 --> 35:14.400
and asked me
when the haunted house closed.

35:14.560 --> 35:21.850
[Security Room]

35:15.680 --> 35:16.540
Haunted house.

35:17.030 --> 35:19.780
-The haunted house. Hurry. Let’s go.
-Okay, I see. Thank you.

35:19.780 --> 35:21.680
Li, thank you.

35:21.980 --> 35:25.430
[Lujiazui Dongyuan Subdistrict
Working Committee]

35:23.880 --> 35:24.680
Get some rest, Li.

35:24.680 --> 35:25.510
Okay.

35:27.990 --> 35:30.420
I can't even walk in high heels.

35:30.760 --> 35:32.160
Don't be ungrateful.

35:32.400 --> 35:34.530
I've never gone shopping with a woman.

35:34.840 --> 35:37.760
I didn't even say I'm tired.
You yelled and went home?

35:37.760 --> 35:40.590
I just want to help you
because you're about to collapse.

35:40.590 --> 35:41.240
Listen.

35:41.240 --> 35:42.700
wear this to work tomorrow

35:42.880 --> 35:44.010
and shock everyone.

35:44.150 --> 35:45.480
Then, I have to thank you

35:45.550 --> 35:47.590
for giving me
this once-in-a-lifetime experience?

35:47.590 --> 35:48.400
You bet.

35:49.400 --> 35:50.110
From now on,

35:50.150 --> 35:51.950
do not buy clothes blindly, okay?

35:51.950 --> 35:54.750
Even if you want to buy clothes,
let me check it out.

35:55.110 --> 35:55.720
To put it bluntly,

35:55.720 --> 35:57.720
I'm the one who hurts you the most

35:57.800 --> 35:59.660
when you wear those ugly clothes.

35:59.840 --> 36:01.240
I'm almost blind by them.

36:01.280 --> 36:02.590
Watch your mouth!

36:16.880 --> 36:18.550
You've never worn high heels before?

36:18.550 --> 36:20.280
You don't even know how to walk.

36:20.680 --> 36:21.820
Of course I did.

36:22.880 --> 36:24.740
But if I take the subway every day,

36:24.990 --> 36:26.570
I can't step on the stilts.

36:26.680 --> 36:28.510
So, you still need practice, you know?

36:28.510 --> 36:30.470
You need to wear high heels more,
practice more and walk more.

36:30.470 --> 36:31.680
All right, don't rush home.

36:31.680 --> 36:33.080
I'll take you somewhere.

36:33.240 --> 36:35.170
Where? I don't want to spend money.

36:39.990 --> 36:40.920
Hey, Steven.

36:41.470 --> 36:42.200
Are you free?

36:43.990 --> 36:46.520
I'll take a friend to your place
for a styling.

36:47.280 --> 36:48.680
Okay, see you later.

36:49.990 --> 36:51.280
What now?

36:51.470 --> 36:53.110
I sold you for sugar.

36:53.360 --> 36:54.420
Choke you to death!

36:54.510 --> 36:55.320
Choke me to death?

36:55.320 --> 36:56.380
You're worthless.

36:56.450 --> 36:58.240
How many candies
can I get in exchange for you?

36:58.240 --> 37:00.240
-You want to...
-Choke you to death.

37:10.110 --> 37:12.400
The reality game experience hall is here.

37:12.400 --> 37:13.720
Demon Realm, look.

37:14.320 --> 37:15.380
What is this place?

37:17.110 --> 37:18.760
How can I open the door?

37:19.590 --> 37:20.600
Is anyone there?

37:21.950 --> 37:22.760
This...

37:26.360 --> 37:27.590
What is this place?

37:32.110 --> 37:33.190
Welcome.

37:33.590 --> 37:35.830
Miss, I want to ask you

37:35.850 --> 37:38.870
if there's a tall and handsome man

37:38.950 --> 37:40.950
and a woman.

37:41.070 --> 37:42.000
Did you see them?

37:42.200 --> 37:44.000
Any specific characteristics?

37:44.470 --> 37:46.590
That boy looks like this lady.

37:46.590 --> 37:48.210
He has fair skin.

37:48.360 --> 37:49.630
He's tall.

37:49.760 --> 37:51.360
Are these characteristics?

37:51.590 --> 37:52.110
No.

37:52.110 --> 37:53.910
My boyfriend is fair and tall.

37:54.920 --> 37:56.360
Madam, calm down.

37:56.470 --> 37:57.550
Why don't you sit there
and wait for a while?

37:57.550 --> 37:58.800
Give him a call.

37:58.880 --> 38:00.840
I did. I kept calling him.

38:01.430 --> 38:02.550
Look.

38:04.280 --> 38:04.990
Look.

38:07.800 --> 38:08.800
Isn't this Jun?

38:10.360 --> 38:11.590
Why is he here?

38:13.030 --> 38:14.950
Isn't that why he's here?

38:18.950 --> 38:20.150
Where are we going in?

38:20.690 --> 38:26.970
[Demon Realm]

38:27.240 --> 38:28.320
Help me! Help me! Dang Yu!

38:28.320 --> 38:29.430
Dang Yu! Help me! Help me!

38:29.430 --> 38:30.800
Help me!

38:30.800 --> 38:31.860
Don't come near me!

38:31.920 --> 38:33.110
I'm sorry.

38:33.150 --> 38:34.420
Help! Help!

38:35.030 --> 38:36.430
He's timid.

38:36.840 --> 38:38.670
What a good makeup!

38:38.720 --> 38:41.420
Dang Yu, I'm going to cry.

38:41.720 --> 38:43.240
Let's go. Don't see that. Go.

38:43.240 --> 38:44.920
Make way. Let's go.

38:45.030 --> 38:46.070
Let's go.

38:51.430 --> 38:53.070
All right, it's over.

38:53.550 --> 38:55.430
No, I'm still scared.

38:55.800 --> 38:57.150
Why are you so timid?

38:57.200 --> 38:59.070
Aren't you scared? It's scary.

38:59.110 --> 39:00.260
I don't even dare to watch horror movies.

39:00.260 --> 39:00.940
Scary?

39:03.400 --> 39:04.410
Let's go eat.

39:04.720 --> 39:07.050
What do you want to eat? I can't eat now.

39:07.630 --> 39:09.360
What do you want to eat? Hotpot?

39:09.550 --> 39:11.390
It seems to be here.

39:11.590 --> 39:13.150
Right here. Just here.

39:13.240 --> 39:13.990
Everything is here.

39:13.990 --> 39:16.030
What are you talking about?

39:16.150 --> 39:17.550
I mean, in the surveillance,

39:17.550 --> 39:18.550
we saw them here, right?

39:18.550 --> 39:19.720
-Yes. They were here just now.
-We saw them here

39:19.720 --> 39:20.880
in the surveillance, right?

39:20.880 --> 39:21.430
Yes.

39:21.950 --> 39:23.800
Did you notice that

39:23.880 --> 39:25.360
the door was closed just now?

39:25.360 --> 39:27.050
Should we go out from here?

39:27.150 --> 39:27.920
I think so.

39:29.720 --> 39:31.440
How can we open this door?

39:31.680 --> 39:33.730
There must be a mechanism.

39:36.510 --> 39:38.370
What are you doing? Don't do this.

39:39.590 --> 39:40.240
Don't scare us.

39:40.240 --> 39:41.030
Don't do this.

39:41.030 --> 39:42.030
Let me tell you.

39:43.760 --> 39:45.400
Don't be like this.

39:45.400 --> 39:46.360
We're old.

39:46.510 --> 39:47.800
What?
You guys can take the responsibility?

39:47.800 --> 39:49.550
Can you take the responsibility?

39:49.550 --> 39:50.950
We're here to find someone.

39:50.950 --> 39:53.550
We have weak hearts.

39:53.550 --> 39:55.490
If something happens to us old people,

39:55.490 --> 39:57.350
can you take the responsibility?

39:57.680 --> 39:58.920
Open the door! Hurry!

39:59.590 --> 40:01.920
Open the door! We're looking for someone!

40:20.590 --> 40:22.250
Now you have a strong presence

40:23.110 --> 40:24.310
and a lot of charisma.

40:24.880 --> 40:26.030
Are you serious?

40:26.150 --> 40:28.030
I just changed my clothes
and had a styling.

40:28.030 --> 40:29.030
You know nothing.

40:29.920 --> 40:32.320
You're a completely different person now.

40:32.360 --> 40:33.030
You know?

40:33.880 --> 40:36.630
This makeover cost a fortune.

40:36.800 --> 40:38.330
The money for those clothes

40:38.510 --> 40:41.200
can cover my mortgage for a month.

40:41.720 --> 40:42.550
And how much

40:42.630 --> 40:43.760
did the styling cost?

40:43.760 --> 40:45.150
It's none of your business.

40:45.150 --> 40:46.810
Your skewers can pay for that.

40:48.110 --> 40:49.280
Let me tell you.

40:50.990 --> 40:52.320
If it weren't for me,

40:53.550 --> 40:55.720
you wouldn't have experienced these
even if you had money.

40:55.720 --> 40:57.470
Do you think it's easy to
make an appointment with him?

40:57.470 --> 40:58.470
You're bragging.

41:00.880 --> 41:03.110
Eating is the only thing you care about.
You will become a pig!

41:03.110 --> 41:04.950
Aren't you afraid that
you won't be handsome again?

41:04.950 --> 41:06.680
It's okay. I'll go downstairs
for a jog later.

41:06.680 --> 41:08.840
Here, a toast to you.

41:09.800 --> 41:10.730
What do you mean?

41:12.070 --> 41:12.990
I know

41:13.280 --> 41:15.030
what you did for me today is

41:15.240 --> 41:17.070
not for my makeover.

41:17.800 --> 41:18.630
It's because you

41:18.630 --> 41:19.550
don't want me

41:19.550 --> 41:20.950
to be sad for too long,

41:21.030 --> 41:21.760
right?

41:23.110 --> 41:23.800
Yes.

41:23.950 --> 41:25.550
I had a great time today.

41:25.880 --> 41:28.400
Thank you, the best tenant in China.

41:29.030 --> 41:31.510
You're welcome.
The best landlady in China.

41:35.070 --> 41:37.760
Dad, I'm the company's manager now.

41:37.950 --> 41:40.510
Why do you interfere in
such a trivial matter?

41:40.680 --> 41:41.950
Without my permission,

41:41.950 --> 41:43.990
you sent a legal notice
to an employee of He Jing Securities.

41:43.990 --> 41:45.970
This is interfering with my power.

41:46.200 --> 41:48.930
I can't manage the company
if you keep doing so.

41:49.470 --> 41:49.920
Bye.

41:54.680 --> 41:55.430
Are you mad?

41:58.880 --> 42:00.030
It's killing me.

42:00.200 --> 42:01.200
People in the group

42:01.200 --> 42:02.850
will think I'm petty.

42:03.240 --> 42:06.440
Am I that kind of person
who's afraid of being criticized?

42:06.720 --> 42:08.850
Your dad just cares about you too much.

42:09.880 --> 42:12.410
Why are you on the same side
as my dad this time?

42:13.240 --> 42:15.110
He is the president of our group.

42:15.550 --> 42:16.880
If you ask him

42:16.880 --> 42:18.150
to withdraw the legal notice,

42:18.150 --> 42:18.950
aren't you

42:18.950 --> 42:20.010
embarrassing him?

42:20.680 --> 42:21.320
Besides,

42:22.280 --> 42:23.540
I think it's not proper

42:23.880 --> 42:25.520
to keep Qian Fei

42:25.840 --> 42:26.630
in the Group.

42:27.200 --> 42:27.920
After all,

42:28.510 --> 42:30.310
you don't know her personality.

42:38.510 --> 42:40.920
To me, whether Qian Fei exists

42:40.940 --> 42:42.200
doesn't matter at all.

42:42.430 --> 42:43.920
Whether He Jing Securities can help with

42:43.920 --> 42:46.150
the successful IPO of
Shan Li Fang Hotel Group

42:46.150 --> 42:47.550
is the most important thing.

42:47.550 --> 42:49.410
I can put up with everything else.

42:52.120 --> 42:53.650
[In the next episode
of "Love Has Fireworks"]

42:54.360 --> 42:55.650
Excuse me.

42:55.950 --> 42:56.840
My name is Qiu Shi.

42:56.840 --> 42:57.970
May I get to know you?

42:59.470 --> 43:00.070
No.

43:02.760 --> 43:03.470
What are you doing?

43:02.820 --> 43:05.420
[Shan Li Fang Hotel Group]

43:03.470 --> 43:04.680
Those who ruin someone's love life
will go to hell,

43:04.680 --> 43:05.540
you know that?

43:12.550 --> 43:13.720
[IPO of Shan Li Fang Hotel Group]

43:13.750 --> 43:15.280
[The sponsor team knows the group's
strengths and tricks very well.]

43:15.310 --> 43:17.330
[I need evidence of vulnerabilities
in the guest room management system.]

43:17.360 --> 43:19.390
[In the hotel business,
consumers care about
guest rooms the most.]

43:19.410 --> 43:20.520
[Wait for my message.]
